# BA Compass — Environment Variables
# ====================================
# This project requires zero environment variables for core functionality.
# All data is synthetic and embedded in the application.
# No API keys, secrets, or credentials are needed.
#
# Future optional variables (documented for reference only):
# NEXT_PUBLIC_AI_API_KEY=         # Reserved for future optional AI features
# NEXT_PUBLIC_AI_MODEL=           # Reserved for future optional AI features
